{"name": "Axyz", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/8dea28846251f6a4e1aab165969cdcd0.avif?t=1778504742\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A perspective-shifting puzzle game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcfc Find the Keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcfc Collect the Tapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcfc Switch Gravity\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcfc Over 100 levels\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/9efb5fcd6d96a9c3f0302dbd16adca46.poster.avif?t=1778504742\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/9efb5fcd6d96a9c3f0302dbd16adca46.webm?t=1778504742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/9efb5fcd6d96a9c3f0302dbd16adca46.mp4?t=1778504742\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Axyz is a vaporwave-flavoured tribute to 90s cult classic <strong>Kula World</strong>. Use your environmental and spacial awareness to find the key, reach the exit and beat the level. Replay levels as many times as you want to collect everything and record your best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/2d2d6a3fb2dbf58080453ae3bd551b05.avif?t=1778504742\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/0cb639a00528741323855a13e83de827.poster.avif?t=1778504742\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/0cb639a00528741323855a13e83de827.webm?t=1778504742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/0cb639a00528741323855a13e83de827.mp4?t=1778504742\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level has 5 tapes to collect in any order, providing an optional challenge for those wishing to push themselves to the limits. Find as many as you can to unlock more levels that provide a greater challenge and reach for 100% completion.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/aee37e7f182934992d8f5df31d706200.avif?t=1778504742\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/7bf61e944065dfe203eb6a186b3addd9.poster.avif?t=1778504742\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/7bf61e944065dfe203eb6a186b3addd9.webm?t=1778504742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/7bf61e944065dfe203eb6a186b3addd9.mp4?t=1778504742\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some items can only be reached by switching gravity. Levels will often have multiple ways to beat it and switching gravity if often the key.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/0cc87dbc5339309834e60701eea00177.avif?t=1778504742\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/b98a6b906ab3cb77e3a0d5c85a4660ee.poster.avif?t=1778504742\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/b98a6b906ab3cb77e3a0d5c85a4660ee.webm?t=1778504742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/b98a6b906ab3cb77e3a0d5c85a4660ee.mp4?t=1778504742\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play over 100 mind-bending levels across 8 worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/667f8b8cd402921ad9623c5ce88b9b0d.avif?t=1778504742\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mixtape soundtrack featuring Pizza Hotline, Major Axis, CAIMANS, and many more.\u00a0 Encompassing Drum and Bass, Breakbeat, Synthwave, and more to create an energetic and dreamlike soundtrack.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Roll, flip gravity and bend perspective in Axyz. Use your environmental and spatial awareness to beat over 100 levels and soak in the vaporwave in this tribute to 90s puzzle games.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/header.jpg?t=1778504742", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["3D Platformer", "Puzzle Platformer", "Difficult", "Retro", "Grid-Based Movement", "Platformer"], "developers": "Space Lion Studios", "publishers": "Space Lion Studios", "release_date": "Mar 27, 2025", "price": "$11.99", "appid": "2850490", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "14 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/-wlG3WtJKRU", "first_seen": 1739491200.0, "review_rank": 1816}